WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Create a location and open its highlighted setup entry or reminder.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.125
Step 2: Complete name, state, trading hours, location manager, first user, ordering email, initial/manual target levels and a new kiosk.

3
00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:21.833
Step 3: Open each step inside the setup popup and save the actual settings there. First user can be new or an existing eligible account.

4
00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:28.042
Step 4: Finish setup once every task is validated. Snooze the reminder for five minutes if needed.
